,"# the old buggy parquet's TRAIN mining count (9974) also clears >=100\n","# easily. This is the actual defense against training on the wrong data,\n","# and it must run BEFORE any Optuna trial, not after a full training run\n","# the way the old post-eval-only check did.\n","#\n","# Only mining has a verified exact reference here (see the note on\n","# FROZEN_SUPPORT in cell 2) -- the other three classes are still covered\n","# by the >=MIN_TRAIN_CELLS floor above, not an exact match.\n","observed_train_mining = int(train_support[\"mining\"])\n","expected_train_mining = FROZEN_SUPPORT[\"train_mining_h3_cells\"]\n","if observed_train_mining != expected_train_mining:\n","    raise RuntimeError(\n","        \"TRAIN mining H3-cell support does not match the locked reference. \"\n","        f\"Expected {expected_train_mining}, observed {observed_train_mining}. \"\n","        \"This almost always means the attached parquet is a stale/wrong \"\n","        \"version of the Phase 6 labeled dataset (e.g. built with the old \"\n","        \"mining_persistence_days=1 bug instead of the locked value of 5). \"\n","        \"Do NOT edit FROZEN_SUPPORT to match this run -- re-check the \"\n","        \"dataset source/version on Kaggle and re-attach the correct one.\"\n","    )\n","\n","print(\"\\nFROZEN UPSTREAM SUPPORT REFERENCES (verified against live data above)\")\n","print(f\"TRAIN mining H3 cells:  {FROZEN_SUPPORT['train_mining_h3_cells']} (matches live data)\")\n","print(f\"TEST A mining H3 cells: {FROZEN_SUPPORT['test_a_mining_h3_cells']} (verified later, cell 23, once Test A/B labels are touched)\")\n","print(f\"TEST B mining H3 cells: {FROZEN_SUPPORT['test_b_mining_h3_cells']} (verified later, cell 23, once Test A/B labels are touched)\")\n","\n","# Explicit, storable pass flag -- cell 27 asserts against this rather than\n","# printing a hardcoded \"PASS\" string, so an un-rerun edit of THIS cell can\n","# never again be silently narrated as passing downstream.\n","partition_gate_passed = True\n","print(\"\\nPARTITION SUPPORT GATE: PASS\")\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"96b573c1","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.007662,"end_time":"2026-09-06T17:39:25.414593+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-06T17:39:25.406931+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## Feature audit\n","\n","The current labeled Parquet contains FIRMS temporal/physical features plus OSM/WRI enrichment.\n","\n","Native categorical features:\n","- `h3_08`\n","- `daynight`\n","\n","Excluded:\n","- `label`\n","- `is_labeled`\n","- `state`\n","- `acq_date`\n","- `h3_lat`\n","- `h3_lon`\n","\n","The current product contains `satellite_nunique` but does not contain raw satellite identity. Do not fabricate `satellite_name`.\n","\n","A future upstream feature experiment can preserve satellite provenance explicitly; that is outside this submission run.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":6,"id":"3f0f4ccb","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-09-06T17:39:25.431903Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-09-06T17:39:25.431609Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-09-06T17:39:25.614533Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-09-06T17:39:25.613177Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.193773,"end_time":"2026-09-06T17:39:25.616183+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-06T17:39:25.42241+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Feature count: 55\n","Categorical: ['h3_08', 'daynight']\n","Phase 6 rule-direct baseline features: ['active_days_90d', 'dist_osm_adit_km', 'dist_osm_farmland_km', 'dist_osm_industrial_km', 'dist_osm_mineshaft_km', 'dist_osm_power_infra_km', 'dist_osm_quarry_km', 'dist_wri_gas_km', 'dist_wri_oil_km', 'frp_max', 'is_first_observation', 'is_saturated_max']\n","WARNING: rule-direct features are present. Metrics measure geographic generalization of the Phase 6 pseudo-labeling scheme, not independent real-world source-classification accuracy.\n","Excluded: ['_state_distance_km', 'ac